Removing the header line on the source csv file was indeed the solution to the problem. I am not losing any data/computations any more. And if I want to refer to column headers in the mapper, I can use a col.names assignment in the make.input.format call. Works well. I am indeed losing the first chunk and the size of this chunk depends on the csv file size: for a 20000 row file, it was the first 1000 keys. This is a toy application so I am not processing multiple files in my testing so far.

I will see if I can figure out how to open an issue for the rmr2 repo.

Jim

