The design of the library is guided by very simple invariants that hold true for the native format. The other formats cause some information loss and their invariants are less clean. A quick look a the package tests would convey more than I can here. If you have better ideas as to improving the mapping of R data to CSV please share. Passing judgment is not particularly helpful.

Antonio

